WEBVTT

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:02.278
AG: Is this something that you've done
when you're feeling lonely?

00:18:02.302 --> 00:18:04.792
You know, you create
this experience for other people

00:18:04.816 --> 00:18:06.646
and it also helps you feel connected.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:10.606
LC: Oh, definitely,
because the cultural isolation

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:13.816
has been something that
I've experienced so much.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:19.574
So for me, surrounding myself with people,

00:18:19.598 --> 00:18:23.466
even though they're interns
and more junior,

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:29.546
but just having them around
really helps me feel less lonely.

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:31.575
AG: On top of building a microcommunity,